Package: microTransfer
Type: Package
Title: Study-Aware Transferability Analysis for Multi-Cohort Microbiomes
Version: 0.1.0
URL: https://github.com/ruiyifan7-boop/microTransfer
BugReports: https://github.com/ruiyifan7-boop/microTransfer/issues
Authors@R: c(
    person("Bin", "Li", role = c("aut", "cph")),
    person("Ruiyi", "Fan",
           email = "fanruiyi@jcut.edu.cn",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1616-0423"))
    )
Description: Implements a four-step workflow for multi-cohort microbiome
    studies: declare the transferability property, discover candidates without
    using held-out cohorts, match validation to membership, response, or
    prediction, and audit sensitivity before assigning an evidence label.
    Functions accept ordinary count matrices and sample metadata and retain
    study structure throughout leave-one-study-out and discovery-projection
    analyses.
